    "['neighbor [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols ospf area 0.0.0.0 neighbor 172.16.1.1', 'parent_command': ['set protocols ospf area [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set protocols ospf area [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Juniper equivalent of the HUAWEI OSPF neighbor command:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols ospf area 0.0.0.0 neighbor 172.16.1.1\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. The command structure is hierarchical\\n2. \"set protocols\" is used to configure routing protocols\\n3. The area specification comes before the neighbor declaration\\n4. The command explicitly shows the configuration path (protocols → ospf → area → neighbor)', 'trans_template': 'set protocols ospf area 0.0.0.0 neighbor 172.16.1.1'}]]": 1,
